25–434; PDF pp. 447–456; local polynomial-time interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§13.1, pp. 320–324; §13.4, p. 343; scans 328–332, 351"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^p\">\\(\\le_m^p\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a> 的总多项式时间函数归约。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathcal C\\;B\\le_m^pA\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathcal C\\;B\\le_m^pA\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>难度只要求所有成员能归约过去；完备性还要求目标本身属于该类。此统一接口用于 PSPACE 等类，不把旧 NPComplete 的参数域偷偷改大。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)$、$A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$。$\\le_m^p$ 使用 [[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]] 的总多项式时间函数归约。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathcal C\\;B\\le_m^pA","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polynomial\\text{-}hardness\\text{-}and\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{\\mathcal C}(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathcal C\\land\\operatorname{Hard}_{\\mathcal C}(A)","display":true}],"bytes":1774,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-262","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness|相对于语言类的多项式难度与完备性]]"},{"id":"f91c580c4bcb9920","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TQBF}\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*$ 见 [[73-df-qbf-binding-and-truth]]；多项式归约完备性见 [[73-df-polynomial-hardness-and-completeness]]，$\\mathsf{PSPACE}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-pspace]]。"}],"outgoing":["69f4f24da36d1d66"]}